=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Dancing Wolf} in {z:Rabao} (G-6) HP #2 for a cutscene to begin the mission.
* Zone into {z:Quicksand Caves} from the Altepa Gate for a cutscene. The entrance is in {z:Western Altepa Desert} at (I-6/7).
** See the {q:Altepa Gate|Altepa Gate|Altepa Gate} page for instructions on how to open the Altepa Gate.
* The fight with {n:Uran-Mafran} (BLM/RDM) will immediately begin once you touch the **Journey's End** at (K-10).
** Has approximately 185k HP.
** Trusts may be used in this fight.
** {n:Uran-Mafran} can use {@g:Two-Hour ability|Two-Hour ability} {p:Manafont} multiple times and has a very high degree of {p:Fast Cast}
*** {@g:Two-Hour ability|Two-Hour ability} {p:Manafont} will remove all applied debuffs.
** Possesses a substantial resistance to {p:silence|Silence} (though **not immunity**). Other enfeebles landed normally.
*** Seen using BLM -jas, Cure VI, Enspells, Protect V, Shell V, Meteor, Impact, Comet, and AoE enfeebles.
*** {@g:Two-Hour ability|Two-Hour ability} {p:Manafont} will make short work of any trusts. Recommended to kill quickly or attempt to land {p:silence|Silence}.
** Will attempt to self-skillchain with {p:Club} Weapon Skills and magic burst accordingly.
*** {p:Black Halo} and tier VI magic bursts hit hard. Damage taken gear is highly recommended.
*** Possesses large amounts of regain and can complete skillchains even if unable to land regular hits.
*** Trust tanks will not survive magic bursts. They can deal over 10k damage.
** You will be joined by Oggbi (MNK), who must be kept alive.
*** Can use {@g:Two-Hour ability|Two-Hour ability} {p:Hundred Fists} multiple times and various {p:Hand-to-Hand} weaponskills.
* Touch the **Journey's End** afterwards for a cutscene.
** Credit for beating Uran-Mafran is retained even if your character is defeated.
* Speak with {p:Gumbah} in {z:Bastok Mines} (J-7) HP #1 for the final cutscene and your reward.

=2 Notes
* Added in the {p:February 2022 Version Update|Version Update (02/10/2022)}.

